<Base title="Terms of use | A Room to Pray" description="The terms for using A Room to Pray." nav="terms">
  <Fragment slot="arrival"><header class="support-arrival">
    <span class="eyebrow">Terms</span>
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <p>A Room to Pray (aroomtopray.com) is published by Inheriting Islam LLC, a Georgia, United States company. By using the site you agree to these terms.</p>
  </header></Fragment>
  <div class="wrap">
    <article class="prose">
      <p class="fine">Last updated 13 October 2026.</p>

      <h2>Information only</h2>
      <p>We list what airports and other sources publish about prayer rooms, with links and the date we checked. Rooms move, close and change their hours, so we can’t promise that any listing is complete, current or correct. Always follow the airport’s signs and staff on the day. We aren’t responsible for missed flights, closed rooms or anything else that results from relying on the site.</p>

      <h2>Not run by any airport</h2>
      <p>The site is independent. Airport names and codes are used only to identify the airports. No airport, airline or chaplaincy endorses or pays for the site, and none is responsible for it.</p>

      <h2>Religious matters</h2>
      <p>The qibla figure is a calculated bearing from the airport to the Kaʿbah, measured from true north. It is not a ruling. For questions about prayer while travelling, ask a scholar you trust.</p>

      <h2>Your reports and messages</h2>
      <p>When you send a report or a message, you confirm it is accurate to the best of your knowledge, and you allow us to use it to check and update the listings. We don’t publish your words or your name. Please don’t send anything unlawful, abusive or someone else’s personal details. How we handle what you send is explained under <a href="/about/#privacy">privacy</a>.</p>

      <h2>Asking airports</h2>
      <p>The suggested messages on airport pages are for you to edit and send yourself, in your own name, through the airport’s own channels. Please keep them polite. We never contact airports on your behalf.</p>

      <h2>Content</h2>
      <p>The text, data compilation, design and illustrations on the site belong to Inheriting Islam LLC unless stated otherwise. You may share links and quote short passages with credit. Please don’t copy the directory wholesale. Links to other websites are provided for convenience; we don’t control those sites.</p>

      <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms; the date above shows the latest version. Questions go to the editor through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Georgia, United States.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>
